---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets'

import struggleImage from '@icons/struggles.svg'
---

<section id="struggles" class="md:split-2 items-center">
  <div class="item md:col-start-[screen-start]! md:col-end-4!">
    <Image src={struggleImage} alt="" class="w-full" />
  </div>
  <div class="item space-y-4">
    <h2>The Digital Landscape is Evolving</h2>
    <p>
      Traditional search is changing. AI-driven discovery platforms are reshaping how audiences find your business. Maintaining visibility in this new era requires more than just standard SEO—it requires a deep understanding of data and user intent.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
